WEBVTT

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:05.818
Turn on Create Versions under Advanced Settings

00:00:05.818 --> 00:00:08.992
A version bar appears above the editor, showing V1

00:00:08.992 --> 00:00:13.328
Click + to add a version

00:00:13.328 --> 00:00:17.315
Click a version to switch to it

00:00:17.315 --> 00:00:26.404
Open its menu to add notes or copy its ID

00:00:26.404 --> 00:00:32.095
Click the gear, then Assign Traffic

00:00:32.095 --> 00:00:40.564
Set each version's share; the total must be 100%

00:00:40.564 --> 00:00:45.425
Click Save

00:00:45.425 --> 00:00:48.965
Both versions now get calls: 70% and 30%

00:00:48.965 --> 00:00:54.542
Compare versions: gear, then View Analytics

00:00:54.542 --> 00:00:58.806
Finalize picks the winner when the test is done
